RangeAccrualNote::safeTransferFrom
├── given valid transfer (from has balance, to is valid)
│   ├── it decreases sender balance by amount.
│   ├── it increases receiver balance by amount.
│   └── it does not change totalLiquidity for the tokenId.
├── given transfer to self
│   └── it succeeds with no net balance change.
├── given transfer amount exceeds balance
│   └── it reverts.
└── given transfer preserves total value
    └── sum of all holders' claimable ratios is unchanged after transfer.
